        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mu-Zioni mulamvwigwa ijwi lyakoomoka lyakuti, Maawe! Twafwa! Insoni yatujaya loko, nkaambo nyika twasiya, nkaambo batumwayila makalilo esu. ",
